      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jonah prayed unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his God out of the fish's belly,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And said, I cried by reason of mine affliction unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he heard me; out of the belly of hell cried I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou heardest my voice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hadst cast me into the deep, in the midst of the seas; and the floods compassed me about: all thy billows and thy waves passed over me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said, I am cast out of thy sight; yet I will look again toward thy holy temple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The waters compassed me about,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the soul: the depth closed me round about, the weeds were wrapped about my head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I went down to the bottoms of the mountains; the earth with her bars",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "about me for ever: yet hast thou brought up my life from corruption, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When my soul fainted within me I remembered the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and my prayer came in unto thee, into thine holy temple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They that observe lying vanities forsake their own mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will sacrifice unto thee with the voice of thanksgiving; I will pay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that I have vowed. Salvation",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
